# Force LF line endings for Zebra source files on all platforms.
# The Zebra tokenizer only handles LF; CRLF causes error.UnexpectedCharacter.
*.zbr text eol=lf

# Generated Zig artifacts. These MUST stay tracked — they are the bootstrap seed
# (a self-hosted compiler needs a compiler to build itself). But they are machine
# output, not hand-written source: 16% of their lines are `// zbr:file:N` markers
# that renumber on any shift, so a 57-line .zbr edit rewrites ~22,000 lines.
# `-diff` keeps that noise out of diffs/logs (use `git diff --text` to see it);
# `linguist-generated` keeps it out of GitHub review and language stats.
selfhost/*.zig linguist-generated=true -diff
